    { "item_id": "FUNC-E01-005-1", "function_kind": "pattern-make", "prompt": "A：中国男孩子为什么叫“强”的人很多？\nB：________", "instruction": "先回答 A，再用题目中的词说一句。", "introduced_lesson_id": "lesson-01-listening-1", "source_record_id": "E01-005", "textbook_printed_page": 4, "active": true },
